    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A Beautifully Presented Five-Bedroom Detached Family Home\r\n\r\nPristine condition • Spacious accommodation • Exceptional outdoor entertaining • Prime family location\r\n\r\nWelcome to 46 Cloon Lara, an impressive five-bedroom detached family home occupying a generous site in one of Mullingar's established residential areas.\r\n\r\nPresented in pristine condition, this spacious property offers superb flexibility for modern family life, with generous reception and bedroom accommodation, a dedicated home office, two ensuite bedrooms and an exceptional open-plan kitchen/dining/living space.\r\n\r\nThe property was fully decorated in 2022, while the garden was completely landscaped in 2023, creating an attractive and highly usable outdoor space designed for both family enjoyment and entertaining.\r\n\r\nA particularly appealing feature is the large rear entertainment area, complete with installed lighting and outdoor heaters, making the garden an inviting space for gatherings and relaxing outdoors well into the evening.\r\n\r\nThe property also benefits from side gates providing additional parking and convenient access to the rear garden, adding a level of practicality that is particularly valuable for a busy family home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "From the moment you enter, the generous proportions and excellent presentation of this home are immediately apparent. The welcoming entrance hall leads to a substantial lounge, a superb kitchen/dining/living space, utility room, home office / downstairs bedroom and guest WC.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation has been thoughtfully designed around family living, with excellent separation between the principal living spaces and bedrooms.\r\n\r\nUpstairs are four further bedrooms, including a spacious principal bedroom with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, a second ensuite bedroom, and a generous family bathroom.\r\nThe downstairs bedroom is currently used as a games room, providing an excellent recreational space for children and adults alike. It could also offer flexibility for a variety of family requirements.\r\n\r\nTHE HEART OF THE HOME\r\nKitchen / Dining / Living\r\n9.03m x 5.96m\r\nThis impressive room is undoubtedly the heart of the property.\r\nA superbly proportioned open-plan space combines kitchen, dining and living areas, creating a natural hub for everyday family life and entertaining.\r\nThe kitchen features:\r\n•\tFitted wall and floor units\r\n•\tLarge kitchen island\r\n•\tGas oven and hob\r\n•\tMarble countertops\r\n•\tTiled splashback\r\n•\tExtractor fan\r\n•\tTiled flooring\r\n•\tNew cooker and dishwasher\r\nThe scale of this room provides plenty of space for family dining, relaxing and entertaining, while the direct connection with the outdoor areas makes it particularly suited to modern family living.\r\n\r\nLIVING ROOM\r\n6.20m x 3.63m\r\nA generous and welcoming formal living room featuring timber flooring and a solid fuel stove with marble base.\r\nDouble doors connect the room to the dining area, providing flexibility when entertaining and allowing the principal living spaces to flow naturally together.\r\n\r\nA HOME DESIGNED FOR FAMILY LIFE\r\nGames Room / Downstairs Bedroom\r\n4.30m x 3.02m\r\nCurrently utilised as a games room, this versatile downstairs room is a fantastic addition to the home.\r\nWhether used for games, movie nights, children's activities or simply as a flexible family space, it provides valuable additional living accommodation away from the main reception areas.\r\n\r\nHome Office\r\n2.80m x 3.64m\r\nA dedicated home office with timber flooring, bay window and storage — ideal for working from home, studying or running a business.\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\n5.65m x 2.20m\r\nA particularly spacious and practical utility area with tiled flooring, plumbing for washing machine/dryer and a shelved hot-press.\r\n\r\nGuest WC\r\n1.77m x 1.59m\r\nConveniently positioned off the main accommodation.\r\n________________________________________\r\nUPSTAIRS\r\n\r\nMain Bedroom\r\n4.97m x 3.20m\r\nA generous principal bedroom featuring fitted carpet, TV point and access to a substantial walk-in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nEnsuite\r\n1.91m x 2.16m\r\nFully tiled with WC, wash hand basin, vanity unit, power shower, heated towel rail and mirror.\r\n\r\nWalk-in Wardrobe\r\n2.42m x 1.82m\r\nA valuable feature providing excellent dedicated storage.\r\n\r\nBedroom Two\r\n3.95m x 3.28m\r\nA well-proportioned double bedroom with fitted carpet and built-in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nEnsuite\r\n1.87m x 1.50m\r\nFully tiled with WC, wash hand basin, Triton power shower, towel rail and mirror.\r\n\r\nBedroom Three\r\n4.26m x 3.30m\r\nA spacious bedroom with fitted carpet and built-in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom Four\r\n3.40m x 3.16m\r\nA generous fourth bedroom with fitted carpet.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom\r\n2.05m x 2.60m\r\nFully tiled and fitted with a three-piece suite and towel rail.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nOUTDOOR ENTERTAINING\r\n\r\nA Garden Designed for Enjoyment\r\n\r\nThe outdoor space is one of the property's standout features.\r\nThe garden was fully landscaped in 2023, incorporating a combination of resin and flagstone tiling to create attractive, low-maintenance and highly usable outdoor areas.\r\n\r\nThe substantial rear entertainment area is particularly impressive, with a gazebo, exterior lighting and outdoor heaters already installed.\r\nThis creates a wonderful setting for summer barbecues, family celebrations, evening gatherings or simply relaxing outdoors.\r\n\r\nThe garden also benefits from:\r\n•\tLarge landscaped rear garden\r\n•\tResin and flagstone tiled areas\r\n•\tCovered gazebo/entertaining area\r\n•\tInstalled exterior lighting\r\n•\tOutdoor heaters\r\n•\tExterior tap\r\n•\tGarden shed\r\n•\tLarge Side gates – suitable for Additional parking (Caravan, Boat, Trailer Etc.,)\r\n•\tConvenient access to the rear garden\r\n\r\nThe side access and additional parking are especially practical, providing excellent flexibility for family vehicles, visitors, bicycles, garden equipment and everyday living.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFamily Living in Mullingar\r\nCloon Lara is ideally positioned for those looking to enjoy the convenience of Mullingar town living, while having the space and privacy associated with a substantial detached family home.\r\nThe property is conveniently located close to Mullingar town centre, schools and a wide range of local amenities, making everyday family life exceptionally practical.\r\n\r\nMullingar provides a broad range of shopping, dining, leisure, sporting and community facilities, while its transport connections make it an attractive location for commuters and families.\r\n\r\nViewing is a must on this stunning property!"
      },
